#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-diff-closures.md:6
msgid "Name"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-diff-closures.md:8
msgid ""
"`nix store diff-closures` - show what packages and versions were added and "
"removed between two closures"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-diff-closures.md:10
msgid "Synopsis"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-diff-closures.md:12
msgid "`nix store diff-closures` \\[_option_...\\] _before_ _after_"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-diff-closures.md:14
msgid "Examples"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-diff-closures.md:16
msgid ""
"Show what got added and removed between two versions of the NixOS system "
"profile:"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-diff-closures.md:30
msgid "Description"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-diff-closures.md:32
msgid ""
"This command shows the differences between the two closures _before_ and "
"_after_ with respect to the addition, removal, or version change of "
"packages, as well as changes in store path sizes."
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-diff-closures.md:36
msgid ""
"For each package name in the two closures (where a package name is defined "
"as the name component of a store path excluding the version), if there is a "
"change in the set of versions of the package, or a change in the size of the "
"store paths of more than 8 KiB, it prints a line like this:"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-diff-closures.md:46
msgid ""
"No size change is shown if it's below the threshold. If the package does not "
"exist in either the _before_ or _after_ closures, it is represented using "
"`∅` (empty set) on the appropriate side of the arrow. If a package has an "
"empty version string, the version is rendered as `ε` (epsilon)."
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-diff-closures.md:52
msgid ""
"There may be multiple versions of a package in each closure. In that case, "
"only the changed versions are shown. Thus,"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-diff-closures.md:59
msgid ""
"leaves open the possibility that there are other versions (e.g. `1.1`) that "
"exist in both closures."
msgstr ""

